description:
Design a 4-bit wide XNOR gate module. The module takes two 4-bit input vectors, A and B, and produces a 4-bit output vector Y, where each bit in Y is the result of the XNOR operation applied to the corresponding bits of A and B. The implementation utilizes individual 2-input XNOR gates for each pair of bits and is designed to operate with specific voltage supply signals.
